<title>UK: EIB to launch dollar global bond soon - Lehman.</title>
<headline>EIB to launch dollar global bond soon - Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Investment Bank (EIB) plans to launch a debut dollar global bond in the near future, joint lead Lehman Brothers said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>CS First Boston will act as the other joint lead manager of the issue, which will be listed in Luxembourg.</p>
<p>Officials there said no further details were available.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
